# QA (M2, fixed in E13 by D-051): a Gondel rider used to be pushed off by
# the camera's left edge (the carry was clamped to it while the camera never
# scrolls back) and fell to her death. Now a platform's carry may take her
# left past the screen edge and the camera follows her left by the same
# amount.
# Steps: st_gilgen_gondeln (A -> B -> C, off C onto the ledge/street at
# x 1401, frame 1133), walk on to x 1433 (camera x 1295, a few steps past the
# ledge), walk back onto the ledge 83-85 and hop onto Gondel C waiting at its
# lower end (x 1296, frame 1342), then stand still on its roof. C travels
# up-left to the pylon (x 1184); from frame ~1377 Resi's hitbox is carried
# past the old camera edge (x 1295) and the camera follows her left.
# Before the fix: held at x 1295 = camera.x, she dropped off the cabin's
# left end at ~1398 and died in the ravine at 1424 (DeathCause::Pit).
# Now: she rides on (x ~1190 at the end, camera x = her x), no death.
# Filmstrip: cargo xtask filmstrip qa_m2_gondel_camera_edge_push --every 10
level  = st_gilgen
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = deaths=0 no_event=Died state=playing
